This is a new printer spooler by Ken McDonell, University of Melbourne.

	chset.h		- BIG character set for banner page
	bprint.c	- banner subroutine for lpd
	lpd.c		- line printer daemon with "operator interface"
	opr.c		- print spooler
	opq.c		- command to look at print queue
	opctl.c		- command to control print queue & daemon
